**反向质疑**\n\n🔴 **[整体分析] 严重漏洞分析**\n今天的分析内容为空。无论是大盘、个股还是逻辑推理，均无有效数据支撑。这导致无法验证任何假设或结论的时效性。**缺失关键信息本身就是最大的风险**，今天任何基于主观臆断的交易决策，风险都极高。建议今天以观察为主，不动为妙。\n\n---\n\n【参考来源】\n- knowledge/wiki/投资方法论/仓位管理.md\n- knowledge/wiki/投资方法论/缠论.md", "claims_cited": [], "data_sources": [], "confidence": "high", "review_passed": true, "citation_report": {"valid": false, "coverage": 0.0, "total_claims": 11, "cited_claims": 0, "issues": [{"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "-0.02%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"-0.02%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "50元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"50元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "16%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"16%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "60元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"60元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "1:3", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"1:3...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "1:5", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"1:5...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "51.6元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"51.6元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "50元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"50元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "52元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"52元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "52.5元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"52.5元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "51元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为